","My cheeks,==W== my arms,==W== my legs...==W== My whole body is finally cooling down...",11,""],["say","avg1_143","I never want to leave this place...==W== I just want to say like this forever…",11,""],["choice",["You're wide open, you know?"],[[]]],["say","avg1_143","Hehe,==W== look who's here.==W== Didn't you say all seriously==W== that if you were in the room, then I shouldn't undress?",11,""],["say","avg1_143","If I'd known,==W== I would have taken my clothes off sooner...",11,""],["choice",["That's not the point here..."],[[]]],["choice",["What if it wasn't me who came in, but an enemy?"],[[]]],["say","avg1_143","True,==W== it would be dangerous==W== to be ambushed in this state.",11,""],["say","avg1_143","But I still choose this...==W== Lying here on the cold floor.",11,""],["choice",["Why?"],[[]]],["say","avg1_143","Because there's no need for defenses.",11,""],["say","avg1_143","I've never been good at remembering faces,==W== and have always recognized people by the weapons they carry.",11,""],["say","avg1_143","But lately,==W== It seems... Little by little,==W== I'm starting to remember your face.",11,""],["choice",["You clearly didn't remember it back at the restaurant..."],[[]]],["say","avg1_143","Hehe,==W== doesn't that just prove==W== that our relationship is changing?",11,""],["say","avg1_143","Now,==W== it's not just your face...==W== Even the sound of your voice and steps,==W== and the frequency of your breath...==W== I can identify them instantly.",11,""],["say","avg1_143","To me,==W== this is truly a miracle.",11,""],["choice",["So... That's why you're so defenseless?"],[[]]],["say","avg1_143","Exactly.==W== Because I am certain==W== that you would never hurt me.",11,""],["choice",["You can't be that sure, can you?"],[[]]],["say","avg1_143","I can.==W== Your eyes told me so.==W== I know you don't mean any harm.",11,""],["choice",["That really is something you'd say."],[[]]],["say","avg1_143","Yes.==W== So I hope you can accept this between us.",1